TITLE Ca species list via selected output totals and all species
SOLUTION 1
    temp 100
    pH 7 charge
    units mmol/kgw
    Ca 50
EQUILIBRIUM_PHASES 1
    Calcite 0 10
    Gypsum 0 10
    Aragonite 0 10
GAS_PHASE 1
    -fixed_pressure
    -pressure 1
    -temperature 25
    CO2(g) 1
    CH4(g) 5
    H2S(g) 10
SELECTED_OUTPUT
    -file ca_species_print.txt
    -reset false
    -species Ca+2 CaOH+ CaSO4 CaHCO3+ CaCO3 CaHSO4+
END
